{"speciesId":165,"names":{"fr":"Coxy","es":"Ledyba","en":"Ledyba","ja":"レディバ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It is very timid. It will be afraid to move if it is alone. But it will be active if it is in a group."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"When the weather turns cold, lots of LEDYBA gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It is timid and clusters together with others. The fluid secreted by its feet indicates its location."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"LEDYBA secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This POKéMON conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"LEDYBA secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This POKéMON conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"LEDYBA communicate using a fluid that they secrete from where the legs join the body. They are said to convey feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"When the weather turns cold, numerous LEDYBA gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is very timid. It will be afraid to move if it is alone. But it will be active if it is in a group."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It is very timid. It will be afraid to move if it is alone. But it will be active if it is in a group."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When the weather turns cold, lots of LEDYBA gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il est si timide qu’il ne se déplace qu’au milieu d’un essaim. Il exprime ses émotions par l’odeur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il est si timide qu’il ne se déplace qu’au milieu d’un essaim. Il exprime ses émotions par l’odeur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It is so timid, it can’t move if it isn’t with a swarm of others. It conveys its feelings with scent."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand le temps se rafraîchit, de nombreux Coxy se réunissent pour conserver un maximum de chaleur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando llega el frío, se reúnen muchos Ledyba de todas partes para darse calor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"When the weather turns cold, lots of Ledyba gather from everywhere to cluster and keep each other warm."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"寒くなると あちこちから レディバが たくさん 集まって 寄り添いあい 温め合う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il est timide et reste près de ses semblables. Il a un sens du toucher très développé."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es muy tímido y se refugia con los de su especie. Al caminar, deja una estela que indica dónde está."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It is timid and clusters together with others. The fluid secreted by its feet indicates its location."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"臆病で すぐに 群れを作る。 脚から 出る 液体の においで 自分の 居場所を 知らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Coxy sécrète un fluide aromatisé sortant des articulations de ses pattes. Ce fluide lui permet de communiquer avec ses congénères. Ce Pokémon exprime ses sentiments en modifiant l’odeur de ce fluide."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ledyba segrega un fluido aromático por los seis puntos de unión que tiene entre las patas y el cuerpo. A través de este fluido se comunica con otros y les informa acerca de sus sentimientos variando la esencia."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ledyba secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This Pokémon conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"足の 付け根から 出す 液体の 臭いで 仲間と コミュニケーションを 取っている。 臭いの 違いで 気持ちを 伝えるという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Coxy sécrète un fluide aromatisé sortant des articulations de ses pattes. Ce fluide lui permet de communiquer avec ses congénères. Ce Pokémon exprime ses sentiments en modifiant l’odeur de ce fluide."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ledyba segrega un fluido aromático por los seis puntos de unión que tiene entre las patas y el cuerpo. A través de este fluido se comunica con otros y les informa acerca de sus sentimientos variando la esencia."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ledyba secretes an aromatic fluid from where its legs join its body. This fluid is used for communicating with others. This Pokémon conveys its feelings to others by altering the fluid’s scent."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"足の 付け根から 出す 液体の 臭いで 仲間と コミュニケーションを 取っている。 臭いの 違いで 気持ちを 伝えるという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il est si timide qu’il est inquiet s’il n’est pas en groupe. Les motifs sur son dos diffèrent légèrement d’un individu à l’autre."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Es muy tímido y se siente inseguro si no está junto a los de su especie. El estampado de sus alas varía de un Ledyba a otro."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They are timid and grow uneasy when not in a swarm with others of their kind. The pattern on their backs differs slightly from one to another."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"臆病で 常に 群れていないと 不安。 背中の模様は １匹 １匹 微妙に 違う 形。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il communique avec ses congénères grâce à un fluide odorant. Quand il est en colère, l’odeur en devient vraiment aigre."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Ledyba segrega un fluido aromático con el que se comunica con los de su especie. El olor que desprende cuando está enfadado es agrio."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"They communicate with one another using bodily fluids that give off odors. When they’re angry, their odor smells sour."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"臭いのする 体液で 仲間と コミュニケーションする。 怒った ときの 臭いは すっぱいぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce Pokémon très sensible au froid semble revivre lorsqu’il se trouve dans des régions chaudes comme Alola."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Este Pokémon no soporta el frío. En Alola, sin embargo, se encuentra en su elemento y se lo puede ver revoloteando vivaracho por doquier."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This Pokémon is very sensitive to cold. In the warmth of Alola, it appears quite lively."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"寒さに とても 弱い ポケモン。 温暖な アローラでは とても 生き生きした 姿が 見られる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Extrêmement timide, ce Pokémon défend le nid qu’il partage avec ses congénères en utilisant Protection."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon bastante temeroso. Junto con sus congéneres, protege su nido usando Reflejo."},{"language":"en"